{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "Sound event + pitch bucket -> ore blocks, matched on exact registry IDs.",
    "Pitches are what vanilla sends for a sound group with pitch 1.0: break and place play at 0.8, hit at 0.5, step at 1.0.",
    "exclusive=true means only ore blocks use the sound; block.stone.* and block.deepslate.* are shared with plain stone and deepslate,",
    "so those sounds only become alerts once they resolve to a real ore block.",
    "Add a bucket to a sound to support servers or packs that pitch-shift individual blocks."
  ],
